            "sid": "NUM 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi Mose yaherejeko gutunganya rya hema, yaciye arirobanuza amavuta arishikiriza Imana hamwe n’ibikoresho vyose biri muri ryo. Yarobanuye kandi igicaniro n’ibikoresho vyaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma abakuru b’Abisirayeli, abakuru b’amazu aserukira imiryango bari bashinzwe guharura abasoda, baraza batanga ibimazi vyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazana ingabire k’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " igizwe n’imikogote itandatu ikwegwa n’impfizi zibiri, bazana n’impfizi z’inka icumi na zibiri, abakuru babiri basangira umukogote kandi umukuru wese atanga impfizi imwimwe. Ivyo vyose babizana imbere y’ihema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
