          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "89",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose amaze kwinjira mw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro kugira ngo avugane n’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.89",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.89"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", yumva ijwi rivugana na we rivuye hagati ya ba bakerubi babiri bari ku mupfundikizo w’impongano w’Isandugu y’Isezerano. Na we araheza avugana na we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.89",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.89"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
